WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.140
This is The Blueprint: how Sanket Tambare dot in is built, drawn as six sheets.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:08.857
Sheet one: the site plan.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.716
A floor plan draws itself: eleven rooms, one per feature.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.995
Archives: eight collections.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.434
Ask: answers, with their sources.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.839
The Atlas: the site as a map.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.200
The admin room is locked, for staff only.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:26.697
Sheet two: the section.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.926
A cross-section: six floors, from the page shells down to the build scripts.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.773
A red riser threads Ask through every floor.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.385
The changelog's riser skips the edge entirely.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:43.780
Sheet three: the Ask circuit.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.999
A wiring diagram. The question: Which forts has he trekked?

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:55.331
The first model's switch flips open; the current drops a rung, and the second model answers.

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.450
Sheet four: the unfurl bench, for link previews.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:03.280
A pasted link runs down the edge, and a preview card appears.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.376
The books link gets its own card too.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:11.479
Then a browser opens treks, and writes the same tags.

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:14.764
Sheet five: the shell switch.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.739
Visitor one's link asks for the Atlas, and they land there.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:22.347
Visitor two prefers reduced motion: Classic.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.628
Visitor three has no preference: the default, Classic.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:31.350
Sheet six: the tag loom, where tags are woven.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:36.050
Coloured threads weave collections, on the left, into tags, on the right.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.404
Life is the thickest thread, mostly micro posts.

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.791
Without the micro-blog, Technology leads.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:50.240
Every drawing is live, at Sanket Tambare dot in, slash blueprint.
